    "gaps": [
      "Child preflight, subprocess execution, self-test assertions, critics and write auditing remain native inside visit; child result fields are carried unchanged.",
      "The 3600-second workflow budget and required receipts are Lunar requirements, not native timeout or checkpoint behavior.",
      "The fixed registered alias makes unknown-action rejection unreachable through ordinary bound invocation."
    ]
